sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Cliente
    participant M as LeaseManager
    participant R as Hilo lease-reset
    participant H as HardwareController

    C->>M: POST /resource/release
    Note over M: bajo su lock: valida el token,<br/>registra el fin, LOCKED → RESETTING,<br/>revoca los tokens
    M->>R: agenda safe_state
    M-->>C: 200 released
    Note over C: desde acá el token viejo<br/>responde 401 · released
    R->>H: safe_state()
    Note over H: espera el io_lock si hay<br/>un comando en vuelo
    H-->>R: OK
    R->>M: RESETTING → FREE
    C->>M: GET /resource/status (polling)
    M-->>C: FREE
